  "description": "The Gavere is the ideal companion for commuting, after-work rides and bike packing adventures. The newly developed, elegant aluminium frame in light khaki with a lightweight aluminium fork ensures smooth running and comfort thanks to its relaxed geometry. With the Shimano CUES 2x10 drivetrain, you can shift gears effortlessly with your fingertips, while the wide gear range ensures a safe, confident riding experience – whether in the city or in the countryside. The generous tyre clearance allows for fast and comfortable riding at reduced tyre pressure. Equipped with fast-rolling 45 mm Schwalbe G-One Comp tyres, the Gavere offers optimal grip and control on gravel roads, forest paths and flowing trails.",
